5. System Integration and Emergent Cognition

Cognition in the Orbital Star Ring is not a single AI; it is the orchestrated behaviour of all layers. Information flows both bottom‑up (sensor → fusion → planning) and top‑down (ethical constraints → reactor settings → thruster commands). Key emergent properties include:

· Resilience: If the photonic layer degrades due to radiation, the Electronic AI assumes real‑time control; the Booster Fusion Algorithm reallocates resources; the Triad updates the maintenance schedule.
· Self‑improvement: The Quantum Algorithm and Engineering Algorithm collaborate to propose structural modifications; once approved by the Triad, the changes are manufactured in‑situ and monitored for efficacy – a closed‑loop evolutionary cycle.
· Value alignment: Every optimisation proposed by lower layers is evaluated against the ethical axioms by Michael before execution. This prevents the classic “paperclip” failure mode.

